# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored — never commit real values.
# Both of these are safe to expose in a client bundle: the anon key is public by
# design and every table is protected by row-level security, not by key secrecy.
# That is exactly why the Phase 1 leak suite is non-negotiable.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
